ns in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                    <span class=\"s-lg-az-result-badge-featured label\">Best Bet</span>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"https://hlasopac.loc.gov/\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '5617840',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                Handbook of Latin American Studies (HLAS Web)\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\">Citations for books, journal articles, conference papers, and websites that pertain to the disciplines covered by HLAS. Humanities coverage includes: art, history, literature, music, and philosophy. Social Sciences coverage includes archeology, ethnology, economics, geography, government and politics, international relations, political economy, and sociology.</div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                    <span class=\"s-lg-az-result-badge-featured label\">Best Bet</span>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"http://hapi.ucla.edu/\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '5617886',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                Hispanic American Periodicals Index (HAPI)\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\">Indexes journal articles about Central and South America, Mexico, the Caribbean basin, the United States-Mexico border region, and Hispanics in the United States. Articles are drawn from more than 500 key social science and humanities journals. Produced by the UCLA Latin American Center.</div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                    <span class=\"s-lg-az-result-badge-featured label\">Best Bet</span>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"https://academic.oup.com/edited-volume/61800?login=true\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '52429322',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                Oxford Research Encyclopedia of Latin American History\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\"><p>One of a series of <strong>Oxford Research Encyclopedias</strong>, presenting peer-reviewed articles on a wide range of topics, such as Anthropology, Business and Management, Climate Science, Communication, Criminology, Economics, Education, Global Public Health, History, Linguistics, Literature, Planetary Science, Politics, Psychology and Religion.</p></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                    <span class=\"s-lg-az-result-badge-featured label\">Best Bet</span>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"https://academic.oup.com/oxford-research-encyclopedias?login=true\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '68918617',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                Oxford Research Encyclopedias\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\"><p><strong>Oxford Research Encyclopedias</strong> is a series of digital works that present peer-reviewed articles on a wide range of topics, such as Anthropology, Business and Management, Climate Science, Communication, Criminology, Economics, Education, Global Public Health, History, Linguistics, Literature, Planetary Science, Politics, Psychology and Religion.</p></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"https://guides.library.ucla.edu/free-resources/home\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Open Access\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/33899/32px-Lock-orange-alt-4.svg.png\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                    <span class=\"s-lg-az-result-badge-featured label\">Best Bet</span>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"http://www.redalyc.org\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '5618393',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                RedALyC: Red de Revistas Cientificas de America Latina y el Caribe, Espana y Portugal\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\">Full-text searchable electronic journal archive of social science, humanities, natural and physical science journals produced in Iberoamerica.</div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"https://guides.library.ucla.edu/free-resources/home\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Open Access\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/33899/32px-Lock-orange-alt-4.svg.png\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                    <span class=\"s-lg-az-result-badge-featured label\">Best Bet</span>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"https://www.scielo.org/en/\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '5618446',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                SciELO\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\">The objective of SciELO Social Sciences English Edition is to contribute to the promotion of international access to Latin American scientific journals in Social Sciences. Its main characteristic is to make available English full texts, at no charge to the public, in order to increase Latin America Social Sciences visibility and accessibility.</div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div><div id=\"s-lg-sb-name-regular\" class=\"s-lg-db-panel\"><div class=\"s-lg-db-panel-title\" style=\"border-bottom:none;\">Additional Databases</div><div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"http://infoweb.newsbank.com/?db=WHNPX\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '5618718',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                World Newspaper Archive (Center for Research Libraries)\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\"><p>American, African, Latin American, and South Asian newspapers published in the 19th and 20th centuries. UCLA subscribes to a subset of this collection.</p></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","experts":"<div class=\"margin-bottom-xlg\"><div class=\"s-lib-public-side-header\"><h2 class=\"pad-bottom-sm\">Latin America Experts</h2></div><div class=\"txt pad-top-sm\"><div id=\"s-lg-box-profile-container\" class=\"s-lib-box-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"s-lg-box-profile\" class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-box-std\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"s-lib-box-title\">Librarian/Curator for Latin American and Iberian Studies</h2><div id=\"s-lg-box-collapse-profile\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- bs3/box/profile_box_content.twig -->\n<div id=\"s-lib-profile-418335\" class=\"s-lib-profile-container\">\n        <a href=\"//guides.library.ucla.edu/prf.php?id=2fadf0f3-9300-11ef-ad2f-0a92c88187d1\">\n        \n        <div id=\"s-lib-profile-image-418335\"\n             class=\"s-lib-profile-div s-lib-profile-center s-lib-profile-image\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/accounts/410576/profiles/418335/Socrates_Silva_Photo.jpg\" alt=\"Sócrates Silva, Librarian/Curator for Latin American and Iberian Studies\"/>\n        </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"s-lib-profile-name-418335\"\n                 class=\"s-lib-profile-div s-lib-profile-center s-lib-profile-name\"\n                 style=\"margin-bottom:0 !important;\">\n                Sócrates Silva\n            </div>\n        \n            </a>\n    \n    <div id=\"s-lib-profile-pronouns-418335\"\n         class=\"s-lib-profile-div s-lib-profile-center s-lib-profile-pronouns\">\n        He/him\n    </div>\